---
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import { facts } from '../facts';
const { business, contact } = facts;
const who = business.legalName || business.name;
---

<Legal title="Privacy" description={`What ${business.name} collects, why, and who sees it.`} updated="2026-11-19">
  <p>{who} ("we") runs this website. This page says what we collect, why, and who sees it. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or {contact.phone}.</p>

  <h2>What we collect when you book</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The address of the home and its spot on the map</li>
    <li>Your relationship to the home (for example owner, renter or property manager)</li>
    <li>What you tell us about the roof, and any photos you add</li>
    <li>The time you pick, whether someone will be home, gate or lockbox codes, and pets</li>
    <li>Your name, mobile number and email</li>
    <li>Whether you agreed to texts, when, and the exact wording you agreed to</li>
    <li>How you heard about us, and any referral code</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Other things we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Questions you type into the automated assistant. We keep them for 30 days to improve our answers.</li>
    <li>Basic technical records our hosting provider keeps, like IP addresses, to run and protect the site.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why</h2>
  <p>To schedule and do your inspection, contact you about it, prepare your estimate, keep business records, and answer questions better.</p>

  <h2>Who sees it</h2>
  <p>We don't sell your information, and we don't share it for anyone else's marketing. These companies process it for us so the site works:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Netlify (hosting)</li>
    <li>Supabase (database and photo storage)</li>
    <li>Resend (email)</li>
    <li>Twilio (text messages)</li>
    <li>Google (address lookup, the satellite image of the home, and our calendar)</li>
    <li>Anthropic (runs the automated assistant and reads the questions you type into it)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you click through to {facts.financing.provider || 'a financing company'}, that company's own privacy policy applies to what you give them.</p>

  <h2>Text messages</h2>
  <p>We text you only if you agree on the booking form. We do not share your mobile number or your consent to receive texts with any third party or affiliate for marketing or promotional purposes. Text message opt-in data and consent are never shared with third parties, except the companies that deliver our texts for us. Reply STOP to any text to stop. <a href="/text-messages/">Text message terms</a>.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>No ads, no tracking cookies, no analytics scripts. If you start a booking and leave, your phone keeps what you typed for up to 24 hours so you don't lose it. It is deleted when you finish booking.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Gate and lockbox codes: deleted 7 days after the visit.</li>
    <li>Assistant questions: 30 days.</li>
    <li>Bookings, photos and messages: as long as we need them for the work, warranty and tax records.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>Ask us to show, correct or delete your information at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or {contact.phone}. We may keep what the law requires us to keep.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is not meant for children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this page, we'll update the date at the top.</p>
</Legal>
